---
description: Isolation rules for Harness, AstrBot, Nango, and MCP sidecars.
globs: backend/app/adapters/**/*.py,backend/app/services/{agent_service,messaging_service,mcp_service,auth_connector}.py,docker-compose.yml
alwaysApply: false
---

# Sidecar boundaries

Product business agents always go `API → AgentService → DeepSeek Harness`.

- AstrBot must not become a second Goals/Use brain.
- Harness must not own Telegram/Discord protocol stacks.
- Nango must not be called from routers; use `AuthConnector`.
- Do not remove AstrBot/Nango from Compose to "simplify" without updating docs and architecture.
- Credentials stay in the connector/gateway. Agents call tools through `MCPService` only.
